.TH MYGREP 3 "2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- search a file for lines containing a pattern
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mygrep(FILE* " fp ", const char* " search_str ", char** " matches ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mygrep
reads the file stream pointed to by
.I fp
line by line and stores lines containing
.I search_str
into the array pointed to by
.IR matches .
Each stored match is dynamically allocated with malloc.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of matches found, or -1 on failure.
